  "b1-u01-l04": [
    {
      "round": 1,
      "commit": "504298b",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-10-02T03:12:35Z",
      "choiceQuestions": 5,
      "ambiguous": 0,
      "glossSynonyms": 0,
      "issues": [
        {
          "path": "items/14/passageEn",
          "message": "連接詞邏輯不順：「there was nowhere to park near it. Nevertheless, Daniel took the bus there」——搭公車本不需停車，轉折對象不清；「Altogether, the trip took two hours. Furthermore, the bike was in very good condition」——furthermore 用於同方向補充，接在負面的「花了兩小時」後語意不連貫。本課正是教這些連接詞，範文用法不當會誤導。"
        },
        {
          "path": "items/14/passageZh",
          "message": "「這趟來回總共花了兩個小時」多了原文沒有的「來回」，中譯不忠實。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "commit": "e9929be",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-10-02T03:27:37Z",
      "choiceQuestions": 5,
      "ambiguous": 0,
      "glossSynonyms": 0,
      "issues": [
        {
          "path": "items/16/rubricZh/1",
          "message": "「前後兩句意思相反」描述不精確：nevertheless 表示讓步／轉折（前句是不利情況，後句是仍然發生的事），兩句意思並非「相反」（參考答案 I was very tired. / I finished my homework. 也不相反），評分時可能據此誤判。"
        }
      ]
    },
