      "reviewedAt": "2026-10-02T03:12:35Z",
      "choiceQuestions": 5,
      "ambiguous": 0,
      "glossSynonyms": 0,
      "issues": [
        {
          "path": "items/2/glossZh",
          "message": "例句「My school is farther from home than yours.」中 farther 作形容詞（is farther），釋義寫副詞「更遠地」與語境不符。"
        },
        {
          "path": "items/2/exampleZh",
          "message": "「我的學校離家比你的遠」中文不通順且有歧義（「你的」指你的學校還是你的家不清楚）。"
        },
        {
          "path": "items/9/audioEn",
          "message": "「takes the train instead of his car」並列不自然（take the train 與 his car 搭配不一致），英文不道地。"
        },
        {
          "path": "items/14/passageEn",
          "message": "「Her office is not the farthest from her home, but it is farther than the station.」比較對象不明（最遠是跟什麼比？）、語意含糊，閱讀理解範文會讓學習者困惑。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "commit": "e9929be",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-10-02T03:27:37Z",
      "choiceQuestions": 5,
      "ambiguous": 0,
      "glossSynonyms": 0,
      "issues": [
        {
          "path": "items/14/passageEn",
          "message": "「Her bike ride is also farther than the taxi trip」：farther 用來比較兩段路程本身的長短不道地（應是 longer），本課教的 farther 用法示範不正確；also 承接上句「住得離市中心最遠」的邏輯也牽強（未說公司在市中心）。"
        },
        {
          "path": "items/15/rubricZh/1",
          "message": "中文題目「因為大雨，我們留在家裡。」沒有時間標記（無「了」「昨天」等），評分要點卻要求過去式 stayed，以現在式作答（We stay at home because of the heavy rain.）會被誤扣，過嚴。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "commit": "f453e35",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-10-02T04:16:44Z",
      "choiceQuestions": 5,
      "ambiguous": 0,
      "glossSynonyms": 0,
      "issues": [
        {
          "path": "items/14/passageEn",
          "message": "Of all her friends, she lives the farthest from the office, so she has to ride farther than they do.：文中未交代朋友也在同一公司上班或也騎車上班，「離公司最遠」與「騎得比他們遠」的比較對象不成立"
        }
      ]
    }
